978 0 obj
  << /ActualText (On an unusually overcast Sunday afternoon\054 Post\055 sat down with a pixelated facsimile of Liam Young\056 A conversation about architecture and fiction ensued\056 In this issue we relay an edited transcript of that conversation\024sans compression artefacts\054 lag or the digital echoes of deinterlaced\240signals\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 979 0 R
     /Pg 968 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

